        <div class="cav">Not a secret, not your house</div>
        <h1>What Your IP Address <em>Actually Reveals</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">People treat their IP address as either a dark secret or a homing beacon to their front door. It is neither. Every website you visit already sees it, and on its own it points to a rough area and your internet provider, not your name or street. Here is what an IP really is, what it gives away, and what it does not.</p>
        <div class="byline"><span><b>Best Answer Hub</b></span><span>~8 min read</span><span>Web tools</span><span>No signup</span></div>
